# AGENTS.md — deleted 2026-08-24 (and in 9078949 before that). It is a stale
# second copy of CLAUDE.md that drifts the moment it is written. Nothing in
# this repo generates it; an external agent tool writes it by convention when
# it opens the folder. We cannot stop that tool touching the disk, so this
# line is the enforcement: it can be recreated locally, but it can never be
# committed or reviewed as if it were project instructions again.
# CLAUDE.md is the only instructions file. Do not remove this line.
/AGENTS.md
